  "title": "ftypes: adjust type list to cover non-type values as well (cid 1550322)",
  "description": "The ftypes enum holds more than type values alone. This mixed use is\nconfusing, also for code analysis tools.\nIn support of those resize the type list to be able to hold pointers\nto those (non-existing) types, as well as add necessary asserts so not\nto use them.",
